          <groundspeak:text encoded="True">&lt;p&gt;BCP625 - Recovery Cap [FOUND]&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coming home from Nanton to Cochrane and made a detour through the area to find a couple of caps.  This was the only one we were successful on though.  Once I moved the search to the other side of the fence and closer to the road it was pretty easy.  There is flagging in place which marks the line you need to find it, even under snow.&lt;/p&gt;

          </groundspeak:text>
